MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8d1a109e3f4550607082930a1a2b3c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: pve_intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MobileIdleBuilder::MobileIdleBuilder.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'Your lab is ready for something new: tournaments. One opens every Friday,
      and this week''s is open now.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Start it any time before entry closes. Starting prestiges your run, then
      you have 24 hours to build the highest net worth you can.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: You race a small bracket of players in your league. Everyone is compared
      at the same point in their own 24 hours, so it doesn't matter when you start.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Finish near the top to move up a league; higher leagues pay more. Rewards
      are crystals and stars, and every star makes one of your items worth 20% more,
      for good.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Open Tournament in the menu to start yours.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
